Huge congrats to the Microsoft Super Intelligence (MSI) team for shipping another model. In about six months, this team built one of the best, if not the best, transcription models in the world, while also developing top generative audio models.

My recommendation to the team: take a long vacation. At MSI, work-life balance must be our number one priority. All models are now available on Azure at lower prices than anywhere else.

@MicrosoftAI: "MAI-Transcribe-1 makes speech-to-text clearer, faster, and more reliable even in noisy audio. Ranked #1 on the industry-standard FLEURS word error rate benchmark. Now in public preview."

Artists and creators can now access a growing set of the most powerful speech tools in the world for the lowest price at @Azure. With these tools, it is up to you how to create or monetize your own ideas.

You could build something like the fun SnoopGPT app or produce a podcast with your voice in many languages. There is endless creativity in the hands of creators, and we listen to you to build the tools you need responsibly. More tools are on the way.

@MicrosoftAI: "The most accurate model across 25 languages, faster transcription speeds, and stronger performance in real-world noise. MAI-Transcribe-1 sets a new bar for speech recognition. Learn more and try it today."

Microsoft now has MAI-Transcribe-1, MAI-Voice-1, and MAI-Image-2 available on MAI Playground. MAI-Voice-1 is a top-tier voice generation model designed to produce natural, realistic speech with emotional range and expression while preserving speaker identity across long-form content.

MAI-Transcribe-1 delivers state-of-the-art speech-to-text transcription across the top 25 most-used languages, achieving high accuracy according to the FLEURS benchmark. MAI-Image-2 has enhanced image generation performance and speed on Copilot, ranking as a top 3 model family on the Arena leaderboard.

@satyanadella: "We’re bringing our growing MAI model family to every developer in Foundry, including MAI-Transcribe-1, the most accurate transcription model in the world across 25 languages, MAI-Voice-1 for natural, expressive speech generation, and MAI-Image-2, our most capable image model yet."

